Thanks for the summarization, Gavin. It is good to see things finally worked.

Just a comment on the data normalization if you are going to do it next. Although control probes are not available in your ArrayExpress download, you can still perform neqc normalization using the derived negative controls, which are inferred from the gene probe intensities and their detection p values. To do this, you just need to provide the Detection value matrix of your TB object to  detection.p parameter of neqc function.

Cheers,
Wei

